# ta_logcollector

[![Documentation](https://docs.taf.ute.nsn-rdnet.net/projects/ta_logcollector/badge/)][1]
[![Requirements](https://taf.wrgitlab-pages.int.net.nokia.com/miscellaneous/static-badges/requirements.svg)](requirements/base.txt)
[![build status](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/talib_mirgration/ta_logcollector/badges/develop/pipeline.svg)][2]
[![coverage report](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/talib_mirgration/ta_logcollector/badges/develop/coverage.svg)][2]
[![latest release](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/talib_mirgration/ta_logcollector/-/badges/release.svg)][3]

Most powerful log collector framework known to the world. Simple in use!

## Supported Python versions

Library should work properly with Python versions specified within
`python_requires` option in [setup.py](setup.py).

## Installation

Generic library installation process is described in [TAF user guide][4].

